    "text": "By Big D Soccer Staff ,\n21 hours ago FC Dallas wraps up a home-heavy month of September this weekend when they welcome LAFC to Frisco. Both teams will be dealing with the international window, as key players are with their national teams this weekend. FC Dallas comes into the weekend fresh off a Copa Tejas draw last week with Austin, while LAFC secured a last-minute draw at San Jose. Read full article",
